---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutPortrait from '../assets/about/matthew-campfire-portrait.png';
---

<section id="about" class="about section-block" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="about__grid">
			<div class="about__content">
				<div class="heading-block">
					<p class="text-accent section-label">Beyond the browser</p>
					<h2 id="about-heading">A designer who learned to build.</h2>
					<p class="about__lede">
						I care about the details that make something feel intentional, from typography,
						layout, and how a person actually moves through an interface.
					</p>
				</div>

				<div class="about__body">
					<p>
						I started in visual design and digital experiences, then followed the work
						into the code. What began as wanting to understand how my designs were built
						became Shopify, Liquid, JavaScript, CSS, accessibility, and shared
						front-end architecture. Today I support hundreds of storefronts, building
						reusable components that still have to look and feel like they belong to
						each business.
					</p>
					<p>
						That path sits between designer and developer. I like seeing the whole
						system and getting into the details, not just making something look good,
						but making sure it works.
					</p>
					<p>
						When I'm not working, I'm usually outside: camping, fishing, a campfire, or
						keeping up with the Lakers. Getting away from a screen is how I come back
						to the work with a clearer eye.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about__media">
				<Image
					class="about__portrait"
					src={aboutPortrait}
					alt="Matthew smiling in a cap sitting in a folding chair holding a drink beside a glowing campfire in a green park, creating a relaxed mood."
					widths={[320, 448, 640]}
					sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 28rem, min(100vw - 2.5rem, 28rem)"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: var(--space-xl);
	}

	@media (min-width: 64rem) {
		.about__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr;
			gap: var(--space-lg);
			align-items: center;
		}
	}

	.about__body {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: var(--space-md);
	}

	.about__media {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.about__portrait {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 28rem;
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		background-color: var(--color-surface-muted);
	}
</style>
